                        upper-class women, who, every other winter, go up into the Greek mountains
                        to perform a ritual urged by Dionysus</p>
                  </note>
                  <bibl>
                     <ptr target="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maenad"/>
                  </bibl>
